        {
          "id": 2680826380,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "The pipeline failed when dumping all the names with\n\n`UnicodeDecodeError: 'utf-8' codec can't decode byte 0xff in position 17583920: invalid start byte`\n\n( https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/jobs/10904426418 )\n\nwhich seems like it would be related, but I'm not sure how a `-1` octet would have been written, and I don't see how it would be any different with the wmem version than the GLib version, because the former is taken from the latter. And it works now.\n\nSo I think that the code should be fine, I just don't understand the transient failure on the one pipeline.",
